  "description": "Enter from ordinary two-foot standing with both feet on the floor. During the raised-wave phase, support on the left foot, raise the right foot, wave the right hip laterally three times with a slightly bent right knee, and keep the trunk controlled. Safely exit by restoring ordinary two-foot standing contact.",
